 113          // Project the object's own position - not a point lifted above it. A
 114          // lifted anchor drifts relative to the object as the camera angle
 115          // changes; anchoring to the object itself keeps the prompt glued to
 116          // it, exactly like a little sign standing on the ground next to it.
 117          // IMGUI counts from the bottom-left corner, matching WorldToScreenPoint.
 118          Vector3 screenPos = Camera.main.WorldToScreenPoint(transform.position);
 119          if (screenPos.z <= 0f)
